      <p><seg source="#source-244-258">いねかけ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-258-277">ゆツさゆさ</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-277-295"><rb>雀</rb><rt>すずめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-295-329">の子どもがあそんでた</seg></p>
